WEBVTT

1
00:00:12.480 --> 00:00:19.240
Okay, well. People, you know what I thought? I made an easy plan for our days, for today.

2
00:00:19.900 --> 00:00:29.860
So, kids, as relaxed as possible, we start at the pool. Sunbathing is until 12:30. Please apply sunscreen every 15 minutes.

3
00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:35.160
You have factors from 50 to 30, choose whatever suits you. By 12:45 at the latest.

4
00:00:35.480 --> 00:00:43.380
Please, no jumping into the pool, and you should know, the tiles are very slippery, I checked, be careful.

5
00:00:43.500 --> 00:00:45.840
Okay, after the pool we move on to lunch.

6
00:00:46.380 --> 00:00:51.000
I suggest a light lunch because of the heat, it won't do us good, the stomach still needs to get used to it.

7
00:00:51.320 --> 00:00:56.760
After that we go to table tennis, okay, and we play table tennis until four.

8
00:00:56.760 --> 00:01:00.140
First we play singles, and then in pairs.

9
00:01:00.480 --> 00:01:04.360
Of course, we start in alphabetical order. Is that okay?

10
00:01:04.960 --> 00:01:08.640
Good, let's move on, so until four. We move on to rummy.

11
00:01:09.180 --> 00:01:14.920
An easy game, just to lower the tone a little and get our brains moving.

12
00:01:15.020 --> 00:01:17.440
Just a second, I haven't finished, just a moment.

13
00:01:17.680 --> 00:01:20.740
So, rummy for two hours, no longer than that, please. Okay?

14
00:01:21.120 --> 00:01:24.400
The loser will play the winner, the winner the loser.

15
00:01:24.400 --> 00:01:32.000
I have the whole scheme, I'll show you later so you can fill it in. And then after that, people, seriously, everyone to their own room, a must,

16
00:01:32.000 --> 00:01:38.120
mobile phone at the reception. A nap, a coffee, inside in the room, maybe read whatever you want,

17
00:01:38.120 --> 00:01:44.520
completely optional, I mean 45 minutes of your choice, but right after 45 minutes you must not be late, I'll be waiting for you at dinner.

18
00:01:44.520 --> 00:01:52.060
Okay, and at dinner no overdoing it, because tomorrow we have a plan from early morning and we mustn't be late.

19
00:01:52.060 --> 00:01:54.040
Wait, stop, stop, slow down.

20
00:02:09.970 --> 00:02:12.970
No, no, no, wait, I don't understand, what is it you don't like?

21
00:02:13.330 --> 00:02:21.210
Excuse me, may I ask, could we have a little time for ourselves? I mean, it's silly to be together all the time.

22
00:02:21.930 --> 00:02:26.850
No, no, but people, I thought you would write it down, because you haven't memorized the schedule.

23
00:02:27.190 --> 00:02:31.250
So: lunch, table tennis, rummy, then a nap.

24
00:02:31.470 --> 00:02:33.290
So, wait, you have five minutes for yourselves, what more do you need?

25
00:02:33.390 --> 00:02:35.570
Here, a paper for everyone, write it down after all.

26
00:02:37.390 --> 00:02:40.990
You have to know the schedule, so that you know. Write it down, love.

27
00:02:41.150 --> 00:02:42.370
Here, hand it out to everyone.

28
00:02:42.790 --> 00:02:48.250
I'll find you some pencils now. Right, write.

29
00:02:49.230 --> 00:02:51.450
Okay, here, I'll write down Maki myself. Maki, do you know how to write, love?

30
00:02:51.850 --> 00:02:53.690
Okay, so, write down the schedule.

31
00:02:54.110 --> 00:02:56.130
A nap. – Since when?
